#~ msgid ""
#~ "The timer's interval is set by the *interval* real number. If *interval* is "
#~ "zero, the timer only fires once, on the initial expiration. If *interval* is"
#~ " greater than zero, the timer fires every time *interval* seconds have "
#~ "elapsed since the previous expiration. If *interval* is less than zero, it "
#~ "raises :class:`OSError` with ``errno`` set to :const:`errno.EINVAL`"
#~ msgstr ""

